% this is the definition for the Standard Model of DNA


dna atom 3          % we have 3 types of atoms
dna atom shape 0    % the shape is a sphere
% usage of the following three commands is:
% dna atom ATOMTYPE RADIUS RED GREEN BLUE
dna atom 0 .75 .7 .7 .7  % carbon
dna atom 1  .8 .2 .4 1   % nitrogen
dna atom 2 .85  1 .4 .2  % oxygen

dna base 4       % we have 4 types of base pairs
% usage of the following four commands is:
% dna base BASETYPE DEFINITIONFILE
dna base 0 adenine.txt
dna base 1 thymine.txt
dna base 2 guanine.txt
dna base 3 cytosine.txt

% draw as fancy atoms rather than simple slabs
dna draw fancy
